asl-weather-announce (1.0.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Added pre-announcement and post-announcement options.
  * Added command line options -b/--pre-announcement and -a/--post-announcement.
  * Added config file options pre_announcement and post_announcement.
  * Added audio file output option via -f/--output-file and config file output_file.
  * Updated documentation with pre/post announcement examples.

 -- Peter Nearing <me@peternearing.ca>  Sun, 05 Apr 2026 10:00:00 -0400

asl-weather-announce (1.0.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * New release with resilience patterns and caching improvements.
  * Added LRU cache for location lookups with configurable size.
  * Added circuit breaker protection for external APIs.
  * Added API metrics collection.
  * Added offline mode for time/date announcements only.
  * Removed weather caching (always fetch fresh data).
  * Removed TTL from location cache (postal codes rarely change).

 -- Peter Nearing <me@peternearing.ca>  Fri, 04 Apr 2026 21:30:00 -0400

